                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi H
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X \in \mathbf{H}
            the infinitesimal disk
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msubsup
                    %mi 𝔻
                    %mi x
                    %mi X
                  %mo →
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{D}^X_x \to X
            around that point is the (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+pullback"}> homotopy
            )
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback"} pullback
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/unit+of+a+monad"} unit
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
